bt about that . It's been very difficult but the guys have done a wonderful job . '' He said the two deaths were not related to weather conditions . ''I can't speak for the first death , but in this case it looks like to be a lack of experience , '' Inspector Gaskin said . Yesterday , a 36 - year - old Australian climber <1 died> after <2 falling> about 150 metres at Mt Cook . The man , from Hampton East , <3 fell> in the Tasman Glacier area . A Westpac Rescue Helicopter from Christchurch was called about 3pm to assist with search and rescue co - ordination at the Mt Cook base . When it got there , the man had been transported to Mt Cook Village by a local helicopter service and pronounced dead by paramedics . The man is <4 thought> to have <5 fallen> much earlier in the day .", "gold": [["3", "causes", "1"], ["11", "causes", "10"], ["7", "causes", "6"], ["2", "causes", "1"], ["10", "causes", "8"], ["9", "causes", "10"], ["5", "causes", "1"], ["1", "causedby", "3"], ["10", "causedby", "11"], ["6", "causedby", "7"], ["1", "causedby", "2"], ["8", "causedby", "10"], ["10", "causedby", "9"], ["1", "causedby", "5"]], "lang": "eng", "mentions": ["6", "7", "8", "9", "10", "12", "11", "1", "2", "3", "4", "5"], "surfaces": {"6": "killed", "7": "falls", "8": "recovered", "9": "fall", "10": "death", "12": "said", "11": "fell", "1": "died", "2": "falling", "3": "fell", "4": "thought", "5": "fallen"}, "sentence_of": {"6": 1, "7": 1, "8": 3, "9": 3, "10": 3, "12": 4, "11": 4, "1": 15, "2": 15, "3": 16, "4": 19, "5": 19}, "first_token": {"6": 31, "7": 35, "8": 54, "9": 62, "10": 65, "12": 78, "11": 81, "1": 285, "2": 287, "3": 302, "4": 362, "5": 365}, "pair_list": [["9", "8"], ["1", "3"], ["7", "12"], ["11", "10"], ["5", "6"], ["8", "10"], ["7", "10"], ["6", "1"], ["12", "3"], ["6", "9"], ["12", "11"], ["11", "3"], ["11", "9"], ["3", "12"], ["5", "4"], ["6", "11"], ["1", "4"], ["11", "5"], ["11", "4"], ["8", "11"], ["10", "4"], ["6", "3"], ["1", "8"], ["10", "1"], ["1", "11"], ["